#. front matter: title
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:2
msgid "プロジェクト"
msgstr "Projects"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:7
msgid ""
"私が開発・公開しているオープンソースソフトウェア（OSS）を紹介します。いずれ"
"も GitHub で公開しており、Issue や Pull Request を歓迎しています。"
msgstr ""
"Here are the open-source software (OSS) projects I develop and publish. All "
"of them are on GitHub, and issues and pull requests are welcome."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:9
msgid "Naos"
msgstr "Naos"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:11
msgid ""
"C と C++ 向けのテストハーネスです。必要なのは C99 のコンパイラだけで、インス"
"トールするライブラリもコンパイラ拡張も要りません。CMake でビルドし、どのビル"
"ドシステムからも使えます。"
msgstr ""
"A test harness for C and C++ that needs only a C99 compiler: no library to "
"install, no compiler extension. It is built with CMake and usable from any "
"build system."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:13
msgid "**リポジトリ**：[vabelorg/naos](https://github.com/vabelorg/naos)"
msgstr "**Repository**: [vabelorg/naos](https://github.com/vabelorg/naos)"

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:14
msgid "**言語**：C99（C++11 からも利用可能）"
msgstr "**Language**: C99 (also usable from C++11)"

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:15 content/ja/projects/index.md:33
msgid "**ライセンス**：MIT"
msgstr "**License**: MIT"

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:16
msgid ""
"**対応環境**：Linux（GCC、Clang）、macOS（Clang）、Windows（MSVC、MinGW-w64）"
msgstr ""
"**Platforms**: Linux (GCC, Clang), macOS (Clang), Windows (MSVC, MinGW-w64)"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:18 content/ja/projects/index.md:36
msgid "主な特徴は次のとおりです。"
msgstr "Its main features are as follows."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:20
msgid ""
"1 つの実行ファイルですべてのテストを実行し、結果を終了コードで返します。"
msgstr ""
"One executable runs every test and returns the result as its exit code."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:21
msgid ""
"`naos_add_executable()` で各テストを CTest に登録すると、テストごとにプロセス"
"を分けて並列に実行できます。"
msgstr ""
"Registering each test with CTest through `naos_add_executable()` runs every "
"test in its own process, in parallel."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:22
msgid ""
"アサーションを 1 つも実行しなかったテストは失敗として扱うため、書きかけのテス"
"トが成功に見えることがありません。"
msgstr ""
"A test that runs no assertion fails, so an unfinished test never reads as a "
"pass."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:23
msgid ""
"失敗は `file:line: error: ...` の形式で出力され、エディターから該当行へ移動で"
"きます。"
msgstr ""
"Failures are reported as `file:line: error: ...`, so your editor can jump to "
"the line."

#. heading (level 2)
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:25
msgid "ArgX"
msgstr "ArgX"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:27
msgid ""
"{{< themed-image light=\"images/argx-logo-light.svg\" dark=\"images/argx-"
"logo-dark.svg\" alt=\"ArgX\" width=240 >}}"
msgstr ""
"{{< themed-image light=\"images/argx-logo-light.svg\" dark=\"images/argx-"
"logo-dark.svg\" alt=\"ArgX\" width=240 >}}"

#. paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:29
msgid ""
"C99 向けのコマンドライン引数パーサーです。コマンドラインの仕様をスキーマとし"
"て一度定義するだけで、`argv` の解析、検証、値の型変換、ヘルプの生成までを行い"
"ます。"
msgstr ""
"A command-line argument parser for C99. Define your command line once as a "
"schema, and ArgX parses `argv`, checks it, converts the values and generates "
"the help."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:31
msgid "**リポジトリ**：[vabelorg/argx](https://github.com/vabelorg/argx)"
msgstr "**Repository**: [vabelorg/argx](https://github.com/vabelorg/argx)"

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:32
msgid "**言語**：C99"
msgstr "**Language**: C99"

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:34
msgid ""
"**対応環境**：Linux（GCC、Clang）、macOS（Clang）、Windows（MSVC、MinGW）"
msgstr ""
"**Platforms**: Linux (GCC, Clang), macOS (Clang), Windows (MSVC, MinGW)"

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:38
msgid "C 標準ライブラリ以外に依存せず、コンパイラ拡張も使いません。"
msgstr ""
"It depends on nothing beyond the C standard library and uses no compiler "
"extensions."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:39
msgid ""
"フラグ、値を取るオプション、位置引数、入れ子のサブコマンドに対応しています。"
msgstr ""
"It supports flags, options with a value, positionals and nested subcommands."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:40
msgid "文字列、整数、浮動小数点数、選択肢に加え、独自の値の型を定義できます。"
msgstr ""
"Besides strings, integers, floating-point numbers and choices, you can "
"define your own value types."

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/projects/index.md:41
msgid ""
"ライブラリは何も出力せず、プロセスを終了させないため、アプリケーション側でエ"
"ラー処理を制御できます。"
msgstr ""
"The library prints nothing and never exits the process, so your application "
"stays in control of error handling."

